    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The concentric vault/lock field, oversized editorial headline, and cyan/yellow evidence styling create a recognizable security-lab identity across all three viewports. However, the signature vault graphic is extremely faint and visually passive; much of the lower section resolves into familiar dark dashboard cards, badges, borders, and large percentage metrics. The header also reads as a conventional dense horizontal nav rather than reinforcing the vault concept.",
